<b>Lucky!</b>

05:06.250 --> 05:09.850
<b>Unlucky for the arcade...</b>

05:09.860 --> 05:11.660
<b>You can play another ninety-nine times!</b>

05:11.660 --> 05:13.920
<b>Awesome!</b>

05:12.590 --> 05:13.920
<b>How’d this happen?</b>

05:40.690 --> 05:43.290
<b>Ah, geez... Manager...</b>

05:43.290 --> 05:46.460
<b>The copy machine won’t stop again...</b>

05:46.460 --> 05:48.090
<b>Huh? <i>Again</i>?</b>

05:49.160 --> 05:50.260
<b>Let me take a look...</b>

05:56.200 --> 05:59.300
<b>Huh? What’s going on with this thing?</b>

05:59.300 --> 06:01.010
<b>Ah, Kako-chan.
There’s a customer waiting.</b>

06:01.010 --> 06:02.810
<b>Ah... coming.</b>

06:04.480 --> 06:06.380
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.</b>

06:06.380 --> 06:08.550
<b>126 yen.</b>

06:08.550 --> 06:10.950
<b>141 yen.</b>

06:10.950 --> 06:12.180
<b>What the...?</b>

06:13.590 --> 06:16.650
<b>Manager... the register’s acting up, too.</b>

06:17.160 --> 06:19.660
<b>Huh? What is it this time?</b>

06:22.260 --> 06:23.190
<b>So where to now?</b>

06:23.200 --> 06:25.560
<b>Time for me to get to cram school.</b>

06:25.560 --> 06:27.260
<b>How about you, Rieko?
Where are you off to?</b>

06:27.270 --> 06:28.800
<b>W-What?</b>

06:28.800 --> 06:31.640
<b>Oh, come on... weren’t you listening?</b>

06:31.640 --> 06:33.670
<b>Sorry. I was looking at a cat.</b>

06:33.670 --> 06:34.370
<b>A cat?</b>

06:35.340 --> 06:36.310
<b>Over there.</b>

06:38.610 --> 06:40.210
<b>You’re right.</b>

06:44.650 --> 06:46.180
<b>It’s so filthy.</b>

06:46.180 --> 06:48.020
<b>Don’t you feel sorry for it, though?</b>

06:49.090 --> 06:51.960
<b>It’s still a living being,
even though it’s like this.</b>

06:53.930 --> 06:55.630
<b>It’s so not cute!</b>

06:56.230 --> 06:58.600
<b>It’s kinda like Tanigawa,
don’t you think?</b>

06:58.600 --> 07:01.430
<b>Not cute and antisocial!</b>

07:01.430 --> 07:02.600
<b>You said it.</b>

07:02.600 --> 07:05.640
<b>I just don’t know
what that girl’s thinking.</b>

07:05.640 --> 07:07.610
<b>And she’s always playing around with her cell phone.</b>

07:08.240 --> 07:11.340
<b>She’d probably die
if someone took it away!</b>

07:11.340 --> 07:12.610
<b>I could so see that happening.</b>

07:16.050 --> 07:19.450
<b>It runs away as soon as it’s cornered,
just like Tanigawa.</b>

07:19.990 --> 07:21.850
<b>In the end, she’s just a loser.</b>

07:21.850 --> 07:24.050
<b>Hah! Was that even a cat?</b>

07:24.060 --> 07:25.420
<b>Kisa’s...</b>

07:26.790 --> 07:29.390
<b>Tanigawa’s... not like that...</b>

07:29.930 --> 07:31.860
<b>Ah, Rieko...</b>

07:31.860 --> 07:34.300
<b>You defend Tanigawa a lot, don’t you?</b>

07:34.300 --> 07:35.730
<b>You should just leave her alone.</b>

07:35.730 --> 07:37.230
<b>If you don’t, she’ll start
rubbing off on you.</b>

07:37.240 --> 07:39.770
<b>I don’t really think of it
as “defending,” but...</b>

07:39.770 --> 07:41.240
<b>Right, right...</b>

07:41.240 --> 07:43.610
<b>So anyway, where are you off to, Rieko?</b>

07:43.610 --> 07:44.810
<b>I’m...</b>

07:44.810 --> 07:46.810
<b>Sorry, I’m going to head home.</b>

07:50.250 --> 07:52.820
<b>She’s always acting the good girl.</b>

