08:23.920 --> 08:25.450
<b>You scared me!</b>

08:25.450 --> 08:26.340
<b>Why?</b>

08:26.340 --> 08:27.720
<b>“Why?”</b>

08:27.720 --> 08:28.850
<b>Umm...</b>

08:28.850 --> 08:32.490
<b>Normally, someone says
“sorry to keep you waiting” or “yoo-hoo”...</b>

08:32.490 --> 08:37.130
<b>...from farther away, and then they start approaching.</b>

08:37.130 --> 08:38.260
<b>Really?</b>

08:38.260 --> 08:40.770
<b>Well, I guess it’s fine, but...</b>

08:40.770 --> 08:43.630
<b>Let’s go somewhere else.</b>

08:41.070 --> 08:51.040
<b>[Kannai Station]</b>

08:43.640 --> 08:45.670
<b>Then... a place where I can
fill my stomach.</b>

08:45.670 --> 08:48.340
<b>Umm... I’m a little low on
money right now...</b>

08:48.340 --> 08:50.070
<b>In that case, the stairs are fine.</b>

08:52.210 --> 08:53.310
<b>Kisa...</b>

08:53.310 --> 08:55.580
<b>How long do you plan on skipping school?</b>

08:57.380 --> 08:58.520
<b>I don’t know.</b>

09:00.420 --> 09:04.160
<b>If you don’t hurry up and come back soon,
it’s going to be really bad for you.</b>

09:04.160 --> 09:05.120
<b>I know.</b>

09:05.120 --> 09:08.860
<b>And the longer you take coming
back, the harder it’ll be.</b>

09:08.860 --> 09:09.490
<b>I know.</b>

09:10.900 --> 09:13.330
<b>Kisa, you know...</b>

09:13.330 --> 09:16.370
<b>...what everyone says about you, don’t you?</b>

09:16.370 --> 09:17.600
<b>“Everyone”?</b>

09:17.600 --> 09:19.500
<b>Our classmates.</b>

09:19.500 --> 09:21.270
<b>Ah, yeah.</b>

09:21.270 --> 09:22.540
<b>I get the picture, somehow.</b>

09:22.540 --> 09:24.580
<b>Don’t you feel frustrated by that?</b>

09:24.580 --> 09:26.780
<b>You can’t keep losing to them like that.</b>

09:26.780 --> 09:29.250
<b>Rather than calling it “losing to them...”</b>

09:29.920 --> 09:34.250
<b>...I think it’s just like they say.</b>

09:34.250 --> 09:34.990
<b>Kisa!</b>

09:35.590 --> 09:38.660
<b>You need to get a grip!
Is it really okay to be saying that?</b>

09:39.930 --> 09:42.960
<b>Why do you put yourself down like that?</b>

09:46.300 --> 09:50.030
<b>It’s like... I can’t leave you alone.</b>

09:50.040 --> 09:52.970
<b>If you’re having a hard time,
then rely on me.</b>

09:55.240 --> 09:58.680
<b>And try giving me a call
now and then, too.</b>

09:58.680 --> 09:59.780
<b>Okay.</b>

09:59.780 --> 10:01.050
<b>Bye now.</b>

10:19.600 --> 10:21.070
<b>Hello?</b>

10:21.070 --> 10:23.630
<b>Yeah. I’ll be home soon.</b>

10:23.640 --> 10:27.910
<b>Yeah. I’m a little late because
I met with Kisa.</b>

10:27.910 --> 10:29.070
<b>Yeah, Kisa.</b>

10:29.070 --> 10:32.880
<b>That girl’s going through a lot of
complicated stuff right now, so...</b>

10:32.880 --> 10:34.510
<b>It’ll be fine.</b>

10:34.510 --> 10:36.880
<b>Dad, you worry too much.</b>

10:36.880 --> 10:38.380
<b>Yes, yes.</b>

10:38.380 --> 10:41.890
<b>If you make a big deal out of this,
I’ll be even later.</b>

10:41.890 --> 10:43.520
<b>Yep, see you.</b>

11:24.930 --> 11:26.260
<b>What was that?</b>

12:08.510 --> 12:09.640
<b>Huh?</b>

12:55.590 --> 13:01.560
<b>[Kannai Station]</b>

14:58.810 --> 15:01.050
<b>What... are you?</b>

15:28.340 --> 15:29.710
<b>Hey.</b>

15:35.380 --> 15:36.850
<b>Does it hurt?</b>

15:36.850 --> 15:37.680
<b>Are you in pain?</b>

15:38.920 --> 15:40.550
<b>What do you want to do?</b>

16:07.950 --> 16:09.280
<b>Tanigawa</b>

16:09.610 --> 16:09.710
<b>Tanigawa</b>

16:09.710 --> 16:10.420
<b>Tanigawa</b>

16:41.380 --> 16:43.180
<b>Wait a minute.</b>

17:16.050 --> 17:17.620
<b>Here you go.</b>

17:43.040 --> 17:44.180
<b>Come here.</b>

17:54.520 --> 17:56.090
<b>Can you eat it?</b>

17:58.660 --> 17:59.920
<b>Who..</b>

18:00.930 --> 18:02.060
<b>...are you?</b>

18:03.100 --> 18:06.460
<b>Gasoline and... electricity...</b>

18:06.470 --> 18:08.530
<b>Are you that sort of thing?</b>

18:09.300 --> 18:11.840
<b>You sure go “buuuuun” a lot, don’t you?</b>

18:18.510 --> 18:20.980
<b>Shigeki</b>

18:18.510 --> 18:20.980
<b>Makki</b>

18:18.510 --> 18:20.980
<b>Riezo</b>

18:27.250 --> 18:28.790
<b>I’ll call you Bun-chan!</b>

18:29.760 --> 18:31.950
<b>Because you go “buuuun,”
you’ll be Bun-chan.</b>

18:39.600 --> 18:41.100
<b>You’re so mysterious.</b>

18:48.910 --> 18:50.170
<b>Are the others like you dead?</b>

18:51.310 --> 18:54.010
<b>Can you understand my words?</b>

18:58.050 --> 18:59.550
<b>Well?</b>

19:18.700 --> 19:21.710
<b>But... I’m glad.</b>

19:21.710 --> 19:24.210
<b>You seem happier than you were before.</b>

19:36.420 --> 19:39.060
<b><i>“To the me of a year from today...”</i></b>

19:43.900 --> 19:45.630
<b><i>“How are you?”</i></b>

19:45.630 --> 19:47.470
<b><i>“I’m the same as usual.”</i></b>

19:48.570 --> 19:50.430
<b><i>“Or maybe not.”</i></b>

19:50.440 --> 19:52.440
<b><i>“Riezo got mad at me today.”</i></b>

19:54.010 --> 19:58.910
<b><i>“I’m glad she’s worried about
me missing school, but...”</i></b>

20:00.410 --> 20:01.380
<b><i>“...it’s kind of annoying.”</i></b>

20:02.280 --> 20:05.350
<b><i>“Why won’t she just leave me alone?”</i></b>

20:08.190 --> 20:11.620
<b><i>“Today, I found something amazing.”</i></b>

20:13.060 --> 20:15.090
<b><i>“Bun-chan.”</i></b>

20:15.090 --> 20:17.460
<b><i>“You remember, don’t you?”</i></b>

20:17.460 --> 20:19.560
<b><i>“I don’t think you’d forget.”</i></b>

20:20.470 --> 20:26.540
<b><i>“Well... I hope Bun-chan’s still doing well
with you, the me of a year from today.”</i></b>

20:27.870 --> 20:30.510
<b><i>“From, the me of a year ago.”</i></b>

